## 46. Contractual Warnings and Possible Consequences

Where Agreement 2 contains relevant non-performance, delay, penalty, compensation or remedy clauses, Meridian may display an explanatory warning.

For example:

"Potential contractual non-compliance identified. Please review the applicable Agreement 2 clause and respond before the stated deadline."

